    src   "Takes a page off the screen and DESTROYS it. To keep the widget alive, use ForgetPage."
    text  "从屏幕上移除一个页面并销毁它。要保留控件存活，请使用 ForgetPage。"
    state machine
}

DreamScreenUISubsystem:ScreenRoots {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamScreenUISubsystem.h#DreamScreenUISubsystem:ScreenRoots
    src   "One screen-space root canvas per local player. Keyed by local player index."
    text  "每个本地玩家都有一个屏幕空间根目录。以本地玩家索引为键。"
