DreamScreenUISubsystem:SetPageHasCustomPlacement {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamScreenUISubsystem.h#DreamScreenUISubsystem:SetPageHasCustomPlacement
    src   "Stop (or resume) forcing full-bleed geometry on one page.\n\nPages are laid out edge to edge and the stack re-applies that on every refresh, which is right\nfor a screen and wrong for a floating window. UDreamUserWidget::SetPositionInViewport and its\nthree companions call this for you; it is public so a plain widget placed by hand can say the\nsame thing. True when InRoot is a tracked page and the flag was applied."
    text  "停止（或恢复）对单个页面强制使用满屏几何。\n\n页面按边到边布局，页面栈在每次刷新时都会重新应用这一点，这对\n全屏页面是正确的，对浮动窗口则是错误的。UDreamUserWidget::SetPositionInViewport（设置视口内位置）及其\n三个同类函数会替你调用它；它是公开的，以便手工放置的普通控件也能表达\n同样的意思。当 InRoot 是被跟踪的页面且标志已应用时返回 true。"
    state machine
}

DreamScreenUISubsystem:SetUIVisible {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamScreenUISubsystem.h#DreamScreenUISubsystem:SetUIVisible
    src   "Shows or hides a page. Hiding switches it OFF as well as collapsing it: its behaviours run\nOnDisable, it stops ticking and its polled property bindings stop being evaluated, exactly as\na page the stack has covered does."
    text  "显示或隐藏页面。隐藏会折叠页面，同时将其关闭：其行为会执行\nOnDisable，停止 Tick，其轮询的属性绑定也停止求值，与页面栈\n覆盖的页面完全一样。"
    state machine
}

DreamScreenUISubsystem:ShowWidgetOfClass {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamScreenUISubsystem.h#DreamScreenUISubsystem:ShowWidgetOfClass
    src   "Creates a widget of InWidgetClass, registers it under InName and shows it. Return pin follows InWidgetClass."
    text  "创建 InWidgetClass 的控件，并将其注册并显示。返回值与 InWidgetClass 相同。"
    state machine
}

